  "note": "Election of 21 members for the three wards of Omagh Urban District on 18 May 1955: North Ward 6 seats, South Ward 6, West Ward 9. Only North Ward was contested. A. T. Blair, a member for over 30 years, was defeated after being rejected at the Unionist selection meeting. The new council was 12 Unionists and 9 Nationalists."
